sition":{"name":"Linesman","displayName":"Linesman","id":"25"},"order":0}]},"article":{"headline":"Sharangovich breaks late tie as the Flames end the Hurricanes' 7-game winning streak","description":"— Yegor Sharangovich scored the go-ahead goal with 4:28 left and the Calgary Flames ended Carolina's seven-game winning streak, beating the defending champion Hurricanes 3-2 on Saturday night for their second victory of the season.","story":"CALGARY. Alberta -- — <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4587843/yegor-sharangovich\">Yegor Sharangovich</a> scored the go-ahead goal with 4:28 left and the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/team/_/name/cgy/calgary-flames\">Calgary Flames</a> ended Carolina's seven-game winning streak, beating the defending champion Hurricanes 3-2 on Saturday night for their second victory of the season.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4233685/morgan-frost\">Morgan Frost</a> set up the winning goal after scoring on a power play in the second period. <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/5216897/matvei-gridin\">Matvei Gridin</a> also scored, and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4319911/devin-cooley\">Devin Cooley</a> made 34 saves to help Calgary improve to 2-6-0.\n\n\r\n              On the deciding play, Frost sent a saucer pass across the slot to Sharangovich, who one-timed it as soon as the puck landed on his stick and picked the top corner, sending goalie Brandon Bussi’s water bottle flying.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4352692/jesperi-kotkaniemi\">Jesperi Kotkaniemi</a> and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4063449/jalen-chatfield\">Jalen Chatfield</a> scored for Carolina, and Bussi made 31 saves. The Hurricanes dropped do 7-2-1.\n\n\r\n              <hl2>Up next</hl2>\r\n              Hurricanes: At Vancouver on Tuesday night.\n\n\r\n              Flames: Host Minnesota on Thursday night.\n\n\r\n              ------\n\n\r\n              \r\n                <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/nhl\">See AP’s full NHL coverage here</a>","published":"2026-10-19T03:06:27Z"}}